{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32455","headline":"河出荣光 · 段成式","name":"河出荣光","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"符命自陶唐，吾君应会昌。\n千年清德水，九折满荣花。\n极岸浮佳气，微波照夕阳。\n澄辉明贝阙，散彩入龙堂。\n近带关云紫，遥连日道黄。\n冯夷矜海若，汉武贵宣房。\n渐没孤槎影，仍呈一苇航。\n抚躬悲未济，作颂喜时康。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}